# The second game, part 2 (started with PART_2): BG-LIBERTY, reached by
# the map alone. Broadway's exit 2 and Liberty's exit 1 put the map up
# (TOMAP); its "loc 1" goes to Liberty, the second time from Liberty itself.
# Object ids are those of Part_2's script.
wait 7000           # the intro, up to Broadway
room 366            # BG-BROADWAY
walk 151            # BROADWAY - EXIT 2: the map
map 139             # Карта 2 - loc 1
wait 200
room 370            # BG-LIBERTY
walk 232            # LIBERTY - EXIT 1: the map again
map 139
wait 200
room 370
